<title>USA: Grist Mill sets 500,000 share buy-back.</title>
<headline>Grist Mill sets 500,000 share buy-back.</headline>
<dateline>LAKEVILLE, Minn. 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grist Mill Co said Thursday its board authorized the repurchase of up to 500,000 shares of its common stock through open market or negotiated transactions.</p>
<p>It said the purchases would be discretionary depending on the stock's price.</p>
<p>The company, a manufacturer and distributor of store brand food products, has about 6.8 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>	    ((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
